# "During any turn you attacked with a Rogue" counts the creatures declared as attackers (CR 508.1), not one put onto the
# battlefield attacking (CR 508.4). Robber of the Rich attacks on turn 1 and exiles Lightning Bolt. On turn 3 Bot1 attacks
# with Ornithopter alone and ninjutsus Moon-Circuit Hacker in for it, then casts Arcane Adaptation naming Rogue: the Hacker
# is a Rogue now, and the Bolt cannot be cast (the refusal). On turn 5 the Hacker attacks, declared, and Bot1 casts the Bolt
# with Mox Ruby (the control). The Hacker was no Rogue as it entered attacking, so this would pass too if ninjutsu were
# recorded as a declaration: that it is not is the test put_onto_battlefield_attacking (crates/cantrip-script/tests).
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Island
Robber of the Rich
Ornithopter
Arcane Adaptation
Moon-Circuit Hacker
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Lightning Bolt
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Robber of the Rich.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Robber of the Rich > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Exile.Count = 1
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Blockers]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Moon-Circuit Hacker.Activate(Ability: Ninjutsu)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Decline
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Arcane Adaptation.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Rogue)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Moon-Circuit Hacker.Subtypes = Human; Ninja; Rogue
! Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Moon-Circuit Hacker > Bot2)
Bot1.Decline
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
[Expect]
Turn = 5
Stack.Count = 0
Exile.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Island; Island
Bot2.Life = 11
